OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith joins opponents of
OL,4,A#1.2bn data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTelevision cook Delia Smith has joined
OL,7,Fopponents of a #1.2bn data centre,
OL,8,Farguing it would threaten a nature
OL,9,Freserve.
OL,11,FCampaigners fear the proposed centre at
OL,12,FKeswick, on the edge of Norwich, will
OL,13,Fcreate noise pollution and have a
OL,14,Fnegative impact on nearby Marston
OL,15,FMarsh.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
