OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith joins opponents of
OL,4,A#1.2bn data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmith, honorary life president and
OL,7,Fformer majority shareholder of Norwich
OL,8,FCity FC, said: "I love Norfolk. You
OL,9,Fcan't be involved in a football club
OL,10,Ffor 55 years without being attached to
OL,11,Fthe people and the beauty of Norfolk. I
OL,12,Ffeel very strongly about it."
OL,14,FBut developer Norwich Apex said an
OL,15,Fecological impact assessment concluded
OL,16,Fno effect on the reserve was expected.
